{
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailbox.AlreadyOwnBox": "<b>You already own a nail box!</b>"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailbox.BoxPrice": "[say: Two hundred gems and it's all yours,] the shopkeeper says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailbox.ConfirmBoxBuy": "Do you buy it?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailbox.CountsBoxGems": "You count out your gems and realize it's beyond your price range."
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailbox.WalksBack": "[pg]You walk back to where you remember you bought the toolbox. There are nail boxes designed to hold four hundred nails. Certainly, you'll be able to hold more nails and ensure you can keep on building in one trip."
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailboxNo.NoThanks": "[say: No thanks,] you tell him.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailboxNo.SuitYourself": "[say: Suit yourself,] he says as you put the nail box back where it was."
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailboxYes.GainsBox": "<b>Gained Key Item: Carpenter's Nail Box!</b>"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailboxYes.HoldsMoreNails": "[say: Here you go,] he says. Now you can hold more nails for your projects![pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailboxYes.PaysBox": "You hand over two hundred gems to the shopkeeper. "
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNails.AsksNails": "You ask him if he has nails for sale. He replies [say: Certainly! I've got nails. Your toolbox can hold up to {0} nails. I'll be selling nails at a price of two gems per nail.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailsAmount.ConfirmNailBuy": "[pg]Do you buy the nails?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailsAmount.NailAmount": "You ask him for {0} nails. He replies [say: That'll be {1} gems, please.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailsYes.NailDecline": "[say: I'm sorry, my friend. You do not have enough gems.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailsYes.PaysNails": "You hand over {0} gems. [say: Done,] he says as he hands over bundle of {1} nails to you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyNailsYes.ToolboxFull": "Unfortunately, your toolbox can't hold anymore nails. You notify him and he refunds you the gems.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.AlreadyOwnSet": "<b>You already own a set of carpentry tools!</b>"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.ConfirmSetBuy": "Do you buy it?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.CountsGems": "You count out your gems and realize it's beyond your price range."
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.HandyForBuilding": " Would be handy should you want to build something to make your life more comfortable.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.JustWhatNeed": " Just what you need to build your cabin.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.TwoHundredGems": "[say: Two hundred gems and it's all yours,] the shopkeeper says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySet.WalksAround": "You walk around for a while until you see a wooden toolbox. It's filled with assorted tools. One of them is a hammer. Another one is a saw. Even another is an axe. There is a measuring tape. There's even a book with hundreds of pages, all about how to use tools and it even has project instructions! There's also a compartment in the toolbox for nails."
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySetNo.NoThanks": "[say: No thanks,] you tell him.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySetNo.SuitYourself": "[say: Suit yourself,] he says as you put the box of tools back where it was."
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySetYes.FeelsProud": "[say: Here you go,] he says. You feel so proud to have your own tools for building stuff![pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySetYes.GainsSet": "<b>Gained Key Item: Carpenter's Toolbox!</b>"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuySetYes.PaysSet": "You hand over two hundred gems to the shopkeeper. "
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyStone.AsksStones": "You ask him if he has stones for sale. He replies [say: Certainly! I've got extra supply of stones. I'll be selling stones at a price of 20 gems per stone.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyStoneAmount.ConfirmStoneBuy": "[pg]Do you buy the stones?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyStoneAmount.StoneAmount": "You ask him for {0} stones. He replies [say: That'll be {1} gems, please.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyStoneYes.PaysStones": "You hand over {0} gems. [say: I'll have the caravan deliver the stones to your camp as soon as you leave my shop,] he says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyStoneYes.StoneDecline": "[say: I'm sorry, my friend. You do not have enough gems.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyStoneYes.StoneSupplyFull": "Unfortunately, your stone seem to be full. You inform him. He refunds you the gems.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyWood.AsksWood": "You ask him if he has wood for sale. He replies [say: Certainly! I've got extra supply of wood. I'll be selling wood at a price of 10 gems per wood plank.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyWoodAmount.ConfirmWoodBuy": "[pg]Do you buy the wood?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyWoodAmount.WoodAmount": "You ask him for {0} wood planks. He replies [say: That'll be {1} gems, please.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyWoodYes.PaysWood": "You hand over {0} gems. [say: I'll have the caravan deliver the wood to your camp as soon as you leave my shop,] he says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyWoodYes.WoodDecline": "[say: I'm sorry, my friend. You do not have enough gems.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopBuyWoodYes.WoodSupplyFull": "Unfortunately, your wood supply seem to be full. You inform him. He refunds you the gems.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellNails.OffersNails": "You ask him if he's willing to buy nails from you. He says, [say: Certainly! I'll be buying nails at a rate of one gem per nail.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellNailsAmount.ConfirmNailSell": "[pg]Do you sell the nails?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellNailsAmount.NailOffer": "You're willing to offer {0} {1} of nails. He replies [say: I'll buy that for {2} gems.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellNailsYes.NailSellDecline": "[say: I'm sorry, my friend. You do not have enough nails.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellNailsYes.SellsNails": "You take {0} {1} of nails out of your toolbox and hand them over to the carpenter. [say: Deal. Here are {2} gems,] he says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellStone.OffersStones": "You ask him if he's willing to buy stones from you. He says, [say: Certainly! I'll be buying stones at a rate of ten gems per piece.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellStoneAmount.ConfirmStoneSell": "[pg]Do you sell the stones?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellStoneAmount.StoneOffer": "You're willing to offer {0} {1} of stone. He replies [say: I'll buy that for {2} gems.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellStoneYes.SellsStones": "You sign the permission form for {0} {1} of stones to be unloaded from your camp. [say: Deal. Here are {2} gems,] he says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellStoneYes.StoneSellDecline": "[say: I'm sorry, my friend. You do not have enough stones.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellWood.OffersWood": "You ask him if he's willing to buy wood from you. He says, [say: Certainly! I'll be buying wood at a rate of five gems per piece.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellWoodAmount.ConfirmWoodSell": "[pg]Do you sell the wood?"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellWoodAmount.WoodOffer": "You're willing to offer {0} {1} of wood. He replies [say: I'll buy that for {2} gems.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellWoodYes.SellsWood": "You sign the permission form for {0} {1} of wood to be unloaded from your camp. [say: Deal. Here are {2} gems,] he says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.CarpentryShopSellWoodYes.WoodSellDecline": "[say: I'm sorry, my friend. You do not have enough wood.]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.Enter.EntersShop": "You enter the shop marked by a sign with hammer and saw symbol painted on it. There are array of tools all hung neatly. A six foot tall {0} stands behind the counter. He appears to be wearing typical lumberjack outfit.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Carpentryshop.Enter.WelcomeGreeting": "[say: Welcome to my hardware shop dear customer. Feel free to look around,] he says."
}
